<h2>Voice API</h2>
<p>Do not use a static Voice or TTS price from progrok as a billing authority. The live xAI model catalog, your account terms, and xAI's current pricing page are authoritative. OAuth availability and API-key billing catalogs may differ.</p>

<h2>Tool invocation pricing</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>web_search</code>, <code>x_search</code>, <code>code_execution</code>/<code>code_interpreter</code></td><td>$5 / 1K calls plus model tokens</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>attachment_search</code></td><td>$10 / 1K calls plus model tokens</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>collections_search</code>/<code>file_search</code></td><td>$2.50 / 1K calls plus model tokens</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>view_image</code>, <code>view_x_video</code>, Remote MCP tools</td><td>Token-based or tool-defined cost</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>OAuth and cost boundaries</h2>
<ul>
<li>OAuth login replaces manual API-key handling; it does not make upstream usage free.</li>
<li>Your xAI account, subscription, and quota decide which models and tools work.</li>
<li>Media jobs may bill per image or per second, depending on the upstream model.</li>
<li>For scripts and agents, run <code>progrok models --detail</code> before assuming a model or quoted price is available.</li>
</ul>
</DocsLayout>
